---
/** The point of this diagram is the line that is not drawn: personal scope
    has no path to the cloud. Everything else is context for that absence. */
---
<figure>
  <svg viewBox="0 0 640 232" role="img" aria-labelledby="flow-t flow-d">
    <title id="flow-t">How a request is routed by scope</title>
    <desc id="flow-d">A request enters the scope gate. Community and platform
      scopes continue to Shamwari Cloud and an external model. Personal scope
      is stopped at the gate, and can only continue to Shamwari Mind on the
      device.</desc>
    <g fill="none" stroke="var(--hairline)" stroke-width="1.25">
      <path d="M104 60 H176"></path>
      <path d="M104 168 H176"></path>
      <path d="M296 60 H368"></path>
      <path d="M488 60 H556"></path>
      <path d="M296 168 H368"></path>
    </g>
    <g font-family="var(--sans)" font-size="12.5">
      <rect x="8" y="38" width="96" height="44" fill="var(--surface)" stroke="var(--hairline)"></rect>
      <text x="56" y="65" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--text)">community</text>
      <rect x="8" y="146" width="96" height="44" fill="var(--surface)" stroke="var(--hairline)"></rect>
      <text x="56" y="173" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--text)">personal</text>

      <rect x="176" y="26" width="120" height="176" fill="var(--sodalite-q)" stroke="var(--sodalite)"></rect>
      <text x="236" y="106" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--sodalite)" font-weight="600">scope gate</text>
      <text x="236" y="126" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--sodalite)" font-size="10.5">enforced twice</text>

      <rect x="368" y="38" width="120" height="44" fill="var(--surface)" stroke="var(--hairline)"></rect>
      <text x="428" y="65" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--text)">Shamwari Cloud</text>

      <rect x="556" y="38" width="76" height="44" fill="var(--surface)" stroke="var(--hairline)"></rect>
      <text x="594" y="59" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--text)" font-size="11">external</text>
      <text x="594" y="73" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--text)" font-size="11">model</text>

      <rect x="368" y="146" width="120" height="44" fill="var(--surface)" stroke="var(--sodalite)"></rect>
      <text x="428" y="167" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--sodalite)" font-size="11">Shamwari Mind</text>
      <text x="428" y="181" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--sodalite)" font-size="11">on your device</text>
    </g>
    <g stroke="var(--ochre)" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none">
      <path d="M300 132 L332 100"></path>
      <path d="M332 132 L300 100"></path>
    </g>
    <text x="316" y="152" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--ochre)" font-family="var(--sans)" font-size="10.5" font-weight="600">409</text>
  </svg>
  <figcaption><slot /></figcaption>
</figure>
<style>
  figure { margin: 0 0 1.5rem; }
  svg { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; }
  figcaption { margin-top: 0.75rem; font-size: 0.86rem; color: var(--granite); max-width: var(--measure); }
</style>
